"alt":"Comparing two ways to build a string, by a cost model of characters copied rather than a stopwatch. Repeated += in the worst case copies the whole result again on every append, so its total climbs as a curve. Appending to a list and joining once copies each character a fixed number of times, so its total climbs as a straight line.",
